        "type": "modonomicon:none"
      },
      "show_title_separator": true,
      "text": "[#](53341a)Not a way into the Spirit World, but the way briefly back out once you are already there.[#]()",
      "title": "Rite of Manifestation",
      "use_markdown_in_title": false
    },
    {
      "type": "modonomicon:text",
      "anchor": "",
      "condition": {
        "type": "modonomicon:none"
      },
      "show_title_separator": false,
      "text": "[#](53341a)Draw a small Otherwhere circle in the Spirit World and work the rite from within.[#]()",
      "title": " ",
      "use_markdown_in_title": false
    },
    {
      "type": "modonomicon:text",
      "anchor": "",
      "condition": {
        "type": "modonomicon:none"
      },
      "show_title_separator": false,
      "text": "[#](53341a)The result is not a body — it is permission to become more solid for a while.[#]()",
      "title": " ",
      "use_markdown_in_title": false
    },
    {
      "type": "modonomicon:text",
      "anchor": "",
      "condition": {
        "type": "modonomicon:none"
      },
      "show_title_separator": true,
      "text": "[#](53341a)It asks for **Spectral Dust**, **Mellifluous Hunger**, a **Necromantic Stone**, a **Golden Pickaxe**, an **Arthana**, and **Gunpowder**, plus **5000 altar power**.[#]()",
      "title": "The Working",
      "use_markdown_in_title": false
    },
    {
      "type": "modonomicon:text",
      "anchor": "",
      "condition": {
        "type": "modonomicon:none"
      },
      "show_title_separator": false,
      "text": "[#](53341a)The stone and Arthana return.[#]()",
      "title": " ",
      "use_markdown_in_title": false
    },
    {
      "type": "modonomicon:text",
      "anchor": "",
      "condition": {
        "type": "modonomicon:none"
      },
      "show_title_separator": false,
      "text": "[#](53341a)Then pass through a **Spirit Portal** to emerge in the Overworld as a ghostly traveler. End it early with an Icy Needle.[#]()",
      "title": " ",
      "use_markdown_in_title": false
    }
  ],
